{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年31歲的潘藝桐曾在劇集《家族榮耀》中飾演「馬來娣」一角而為人認知，今年5月她驚喜宣布接受男友的求婚，正式步入準人妻的行列。最近她一直忙於籌備婚禮，並在社交平台分享了傳統「過大禮」儀式的短片，當中見到聘禮包括紅盒、禮籃、海味及金器等傳統聘禮，當中5對「流星錘」龍鳳鈪更是十分吸睛。</p><figure><img alt=\"過大禮。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171900826936283136389104.jpeg/YIIjiOxn-ez1Um5SMi16xB3J_Xh-hvdyM7iS0zO4ktM\"/><figcaption>過大禮。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>拍攝婚照花絮與大家分享</p><p>潘藝桐除了早前分享了她的婚照外，昨日（20）繼續在社交平台分享喜悅，她寫下：「Behind the scenes.」照片是她與男友拍攝婚照的花絮照，二人於一座莊園內拍攝，多張的手牽手照令人感到他們的甜蜜，還有一張在光影下的親吻照，簡直就是閃瞎所有人。</p><figure><img alt=\"潘藝桐繼續在社交平台分享喜悅。(ig@pearlpoon)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178489512158957568427165.jpeg/E4tpyPG3NbdL1CjvwrDilgF9vvT4n-qRz8fLpM_Hy6Q\"/><figcaption>潘藝桐繼續在社交平台分享喜悅。(ig@pearlpoon)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"潘藝桐同老公於一座莊園內拍攝。(ig@pearlpoon)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178489509898096640467398.jpeg/eBTyiYCXvB4Zu3nVmITs9BywHdDSf4FxZjeaCWY3mgk\"/><figcaption>潘藝桐同老公於一座莊園內拍攝。(ig@pearlpoon)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"潘藝桐同老公好sweet。(ig@pearlpoon)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178489518920568832164398.jpeg/PSn4bKiLKOayciM_2MjoVVd_oo5A9sEDnTlQyp05UMo\"/><figcaption>潘藝桐同老公好sweet。(ig@pearlpoon)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"潘藝桐分享BTS相。(ig@pearlpoon)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178489516630347776521690.jpeg/R7XAV3OSXLnOKM4rbSFLqEi9g-RA-CWeshxXxrIcV8Y\"/><figcaption>潘藝桐分享BTS相。(ig@pearlpoon)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"潘藝桐。(ig@pearlpoon)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178489514432401408217958.jpeg/01ugHYf5e_1Lq8xB9nUClkyu3uBC32mWbwPyQG8D8kA\"/><figcaption>潘藝桐。(ig@pearlpoon)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"潘藝桐。(ig@pearlpoon)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178489512268009472596201.jpeg/WLQJub_dxh8XDftRX6VAgmf961CidEY_6fs9fun7PX4\"/><figcaption>潘藝桐。(ig@pearlpoon)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"潘藝桐。(ig@pearlpoon)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178489510078451712953768.jpeg/FrA0JiIPpPUCNA5SjpFswToxpTllSlYbnlae555Wnuc\"/><figcaption>潘藝桐。(ig@pearlpoon)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T01:29:21.225754+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":460,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}